  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Books mentioned in vol. 29 are The Summer without Men (Siri Hustvedt), The Pregnant Widow (Martin Amis), Lost in a Good Book (Jasper Fforde), The Helmet of Horror (Victor Pelevin), Invisible Monsters (Chuck Palahniuk), The Well of Lost Plots (Jasper Fforde). Also mentioned were War and Peace (Leo Tolstoy), Heads You Lose (Lisa Lutz, David Hayward), Middlemarch (George Eliot), and Franz Kafka.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
